OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy this evening with some clear
OL,7,Fspells developing, though cloud
OL,8,Fincreasing overnight. Largely dry
OL,9,Fthrough the evening, but the odd
OL,10,Fshower developing through the early
OL,11,Fhours. Chilly.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FSome early morning sunny
OL,14,Fspells possible, then becoming largely
OL,15,Fcloudy through the day, but remaining
OL,16,Fmostly dry. A fresh breeze, easing
OL,17,Fthrough the afternoon. Temperatures
OL,18,Faround normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
